Spoiler

In order to get Excalibur by dipping a long sword, you need to be:

1. At least level 5 experience (Not dungeon level 5.)
2. Wielding the longsword when you dip it..

Your alignment doesn't matter, nor does the cursed/blessed status of
the longsword.

(BTW, #2 I am only 90% sure of.  But it seems to really help.)

